{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56847","headline":"陆禹臣赠吴生诗二首 二 · 不详","name":"陆禹臣赠吴生诗二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"露下瑶簪滋，云生石室寒。\n星坛鸾鹤舞，丹竃虎龙蟠。\n尘世人情窄，壸中景界宽。\n凭君高着眼，物外试回观。\n（见郑方坤《五代诗话》卷九引《广远府志》。\n）（按：《全唐诗》卷八六一收後诗之前四句。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56847.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56847","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}